            <fullName>rank_portfolio_risks_179We000000q4XP</fullName>
            <description>Portfolio-level competing-grant risk. Ranks governed Headroom scopes (category + country + fiscal year) across the current scenario by collision risk, tightest headroom, or most competition — for questions like &apos;where are our biggest competing-grant risks?&apos;, &apos;which countries have the tightest Core Program headroom?&apos;, &apos;show me the top 10 headroom collision risks&apos;. Optional category/country/fiscalYear filters and topN.</description>
