            <fullName>rank_headroom_179We000000q4XQ</fullName>
            <description>Ranks governed Country + Program Headroom groups (AGGREGATED across all qualifying Budget Lines per governed category — never individual Budget Lines) for portfolio questions like &apos;which programs and countries have the largest funding gap in FY2029?&apos;. Returns a concise top-8-by-default executive list; the underlying Budget Lines are summed first, then the aggregated groups are ranked.</description>
            <developerName>rank_headroom_179We000000q4XQ</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>AmaizeRankHeadroom</invocationTarget>
