        </localActions>
        <localActions>
            <fullName>compare_headroom_179We000000q4XQ</fullName>
            <description>Concise multi-country Headroom comparison. Resolves ONE governed program/category across SEVERAL countries for a fiscal year and returns a single compact comparison — a lead interpretation, one compact line per country (Funding Gap or Available Headroom, with Secured and Pipeline), and which country has the largest gap — instead of a full financial block per country. Each country is resolved through the same governed engine as a single-country query, so the figures match. Use this whenever the user asks for headroom or funding gap for one program across two or more countries.</description>
            <developerName>compare_headroom_179We000000q4XQ</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>AmaizeCompareHeadroom</invocationTarget>
